# Force LF line endings for text files regardless of local OS/git config.
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) silently convert shell
# scripts to CRLF, which then fail to parse on Linux (the VPS/containers) with
# cryptic "syntax error: end of file unexpected" errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
